WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.056
Raj: We've got one deprecation warning per startup. It references our legacy token callback.
每次启动有一个弃用警告，指向旧令牌回调。

2
00:00:07.056 --> 00:00:14.903
Hannah: Does it precede an actual authentication failure? Compare events across a full refresh cycle.
之后有实际认证失败吗？跨完整刷新周期比较事件。

3
00:00:14.903 --> 00:00:23.183
Anika: The canary cohort refreshed tokens successfully twice. Our working hypothesis is future compatibility risk.
灰度组已成功刷新两次，当前假设是未来兼容风险。

4
00:00:23.183 --> 00:00:30.022
Priya: Just to confirm, no failed writes, right? Keep the warning separate from error counts.
确认一下，没有写入失败，对吧？警告与错误计数分开。

5
00:00:30.022 --> 00:00:35.782
Lukas: Check when the callback will be removed. A warning still deserves an owned task.
查回调何时被移除，警告仍需有人负责处理。

6
00:00:35.782 --> 00:00:43.318
Raj: Okay, that becomes my next action item. Maybe the replacement needs its own compatibility review.
好，列为我的下一项任务，替代接口可能另需兼容评审。

7
00:00:43.318 --> 00:00:53.205
Hannah: Current documentation confirms support in this release. Tests show successful refresh, not future guarantees.
当前文档确认本版本仍支持，测试说明目前刷新成功，不保证未来。

8
00:00:53.205 --> 00:01:00.093
Anika: I'll keep an eye on latency too. The steady-state comparison matches our previous baseline.
我也关注延迟，稳定运行对比与旧基线一致。

9
00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:07.244
Lukas: Record the observation period and sample size. Avoid claiming every workload is fully covered.
记录观察时段和样本量，不宣称覆盖所有负载。

10
00:01:07.244 --> 00:01:14.300
Priya: Agreed, expansion waits for the review decision. The warning gets a deadline, not silence.
同意，扩大要等评审决定，警告设期限，不直接静音。

